# Hosts a sandbox may reach, one POSIX extended regex per line.
#
# `FilterDefaultDeny Yes` in tinyproxy.conf means anything absent from this file
# is refused. Anchor each entry (`^…$`) so `evil-pypi.org.attacker.com` cannot
# match the `pypi.org` line.
#
# The defaults are the package registries an agent needs to install what its
# script imports. Add your own APIs; remove what you do not want reachable.

^(.+\.)?pypi\.org$
^(.+\.)?pythonhosted\.org$
^(.+\.)?npmjs\.org$
^(.+\.)?npmjs\.com$
^registry\.npmjs\.org$
^(.+\.)?bun\.sh$
^(.+\.)?astral\.sh$
